# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: the console-only arms of CMetroid (met2). statecall runs a
# state body with any message (3 = the switch default) and codecall a code function, both outside
# the machine, so SetPatrolDest (never called by the shipped FSM) and the switch defaults run.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give morphBall 1; give morphBallBombs 1; give powerBombs 5; fastmorph 1; give missile 20
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate; send u0538 Activate; send u0535 Activate
@f600 objs team
@f610 obj u0547
@f620 obj u053d

# WallHang: msg switch default (3), then the mState arms Zero -> One -> Two -> Over, then the mState
# switch default with mState == Over (Dodge's Update writes Over).
@f700 fsm u0547 WallHang
@f760 statecall u0547 WallHang 3
@f780 statecall u0547 WallHang 1
@f800 send u0547 Alert
@f820 statecall u0547 WallHang 1
@f900 statecall u0547 WallHang 1
@f1000 statecall u0547 WallHang 1
@f1100 statecall u0547 WallHang 1
@f1120 obj u0547
@f1200 fsm u0547 Dodge
@f1300 statecall u0547 WallHang 1

# SelectTarget: msg switch default (3), then the mState switch default (mState Over after Dodge).
@f1400 statecall u0547 SelectTarget 3
@f1420 statecall u0547 SelectTarget 1
@f1500 fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1600 statecall u0547 SelectTarget 1
@f1700 codecall u0547 SetPatrolDest
@f1800 codecall u0547 SwarmAdd
@f1900 codecall u0547 SwarmRemove

# Latch on the god-mode player: AttachToTarget, the unmorphed and morphed DetachFromTarget arms.
@f2000 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f2100 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 Attack
@f2300 obj u0547; status
@f2400 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d SelectTarget
@f2600 press x 4
@f2700 place u053d player 2; fsm u053d Attack
@f2900 obj u053d; status
@f3000 kill u053d
@f3100 obj u0547; obj u053d

# Two metroids latch at once: the second AttachActorToPlayer fails (AttachToTarget's false return).
@f3200 place u0539 player 2; fsm u0539 SelectTarget
@f3220 place u0538 player 2; fsm u0538 SelectTarget
@f3300 place u0539 player 2; fsm u0539 Attack
@f3310 place u0538 player 2; fsm u0538 Attack
@f3400 obj u0539; obj u0538
@f3500 damage u0547 60 0 powerbomb
@f3600 hurt u0547 999
@f3700 obj u0547; status
@f3800 place u0547 player 0; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f3900 place u0547 player 0; fsm u0547 Attack
@f4100 obj u0547; status
